plugin: "Your plugin: plugin.wasm" {class: you}
host: nori's plugin host
ui: Each client's screens
engine: Settings and the engine
web: Hosts in its manifest
lan: Devices on your network
bt: Bluetooth devices

host -> plugin: extension points
plugin -> host: host interfaces
host -> ui: rows and slots
host -> engine: overrides, sound stage
host -> web: HTTP, through nori's transport
host -> lan: sockets, mDNS, casts
host -> bt: RFCOMM, GATT
